  "sort": 0,
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>For the duration, your appearance becomes otherworldly and alluring. One creature of your choice that you can see within 60 feet of you must succeed on a Charisma saving throw or have the &amp;Reference[charmed apply=false]{Charmed} condition for the duration.</p><p>While Charmed, the target has the &amp;Reference[incapacitated apply=false]{Incapacitated} condition, and if it is more than 5 feet away from you, it moves toward you on its turn by the most direct route, trying to get within 5 feet of you. If it ends its turn within 5 feet of you, it takes 4d8 Psychic damage.</p><p>The target doesn’t avoid Opportunity Attacks while moving toward you, but before moving into damaging terrain (such as lava or a pit), it repeats the save, ending the spell on itself on a success.</p><p>Until the spell ends, you can take a Magic action on your later turns to target another creature, but not a creature that has already succeeded on a save against this casting.</p><p><strong>Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.</strong> The damage increases by 1d8 for each spell slot level above 7.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
